The modifications are distributed as patches/agens-volundr.patch, which applies to SGLang commit
4051b19cc2cd7fd8903ceec1d084a69b56c6df4d. The container images built from docker/Dockerfile contain
SGLang at that commit with the patch applied, installed over the official lmsysorg/sglang:v0.5.16
runtime image. The DFlash2 drafter support (DFlash2DraftModel, its candidate selector and grouped
convolutions) is adapted from later upstream SGLang sources, also Apache-2.0.

